      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استقبحهُ</span></b>  <i>He regarded him,</i> or <i>it, as bad,
evil, abominable, foul, unseemly, unsightly, ugly,</i>
or <i>hideous;</i> (TA;) <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استحسنهُ</span>. (S, * K.)

